=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync review-rhel -----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. Set servers on Rocky Linux 10, whose$
# chrony reads no directory of the administrator's: in$
# /etc/chrony.conf the pool commented out and two lines added$
# under a comment naming them, then a restart.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Set servers ##################################################$
$
# Note$
# hardn's servers take the place of the host's own. Remove$
# servers puts those back.$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Server               192.0.2.10 by hardn$
   -  Server               192.0.2.11 by hardn$
$
   -  Set chrony's servers$
      /etc/chrony.conf$
      @@ -1,7 +1,10 @@$
       # Use four public NTP servers from the pool.ntp.org$
      | project. If this$
       # host has a static public IP address, please consider$
      | joining the pool:$
       # https://www.ntppool.org/join.html$
      -pool 2.rocky.pool.ntp.org iburst$
      +#hardn: pool 2.rocky.pool.ntp.org iburst$
      +# Added by hardn (NTP Settings): the 2 lines below.$
      +server 192.0.2.10 iburst$
      +server 192.0.2.11 iburst$
$
       # Use NTP servers from DHCP.$
       sourcedir /run/chrony-dhcp$
$
   -  Restart chrony$
      chronyd$
      $ systemctl restart chronyd$
$
  Set time servers? [y/N, 0 or q]: $
$
$

